<section class="panel-white">
  <div class="section max-w-3xl">
    {{> section-head heading="Privacy Policy"}}

    <div class="mt-8 rounded-none border border-al-line bg-al-panel px-5 py-4 text-sm text-al-ink/70">
      <strong class="text-al-navy">Placeholder content.</strong> This page uses standard boilerplate language and has not been reviewed by legal counsel. Replace it with your reviewed policy before relying on it.
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">
      <p>Last updated: {{year}}</p>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">Information We Collect</h3>
        <p class="mt-3">When you visit our site, place an order, create an account, or sign up for our newsletter, we may collect information such as your name, email address, shipping address, and payment details.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">How We Use Your Information</h3>
        <p class="mt-3">We use the information we collect to process orders, provide customer support, send order and account updates, and — where you've opted in — send marketing communications.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">Sharing Your Information</h3>
        <p class="mt-3">We do not sell your personal information. We share information only with service providers who help us operate our business, such as payment processors and shipping carriers.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">Cookies</h3>
        <p class="mt-3">Our site uses cookies to keep your cart working correctly and to understand how the site is used.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">Your Choices</h3>
        <p class="mt-3">You may unsubscribe from marketing emails at any time. To request access to, or deletion of, your personal information, contact us below.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">Contact Us</h3>
        <p class="mt-3">Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:hello@animalifeusa.com" class="text-al-navy underline">hello@animalifeusa.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
